# HakiOS defconfig for the Huawei MateBook E Go 2023 (gaokun3, SC8280XP / Snapdragon 8cx Gen 3, devices/gaokun3):
# the common kernel's configuration, the SC8280XP SoC family's facts and this device's own, put together
# the way Android puts a device's kernel configuration together.
#
# The open profile: this machine runs Windows/Linux and has no adb and no vendor firmware鍒嗗尯 to pull,
# so nothing of the device's own firmware is loaded (no GPU, Wi-Fi, audio, camera or modem arguments).
# The SoC-family drivers (socinfo, cpufreq, thermal, pmic) are built in; every phone driver of the
# common repository is left out of the kernel until it has been made to work here.

#include common_defconfig
#include open.config
#include sc8280xp.config
#include gaokun3.config
